    "transcript": "French people, you must see me in this season. I will attack."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00123",
    "start": 293.15,
    "end": 298.15,
    "transcript": "The pilot of the King of Europe, the stupid crew. We will ask some questions in English to our friend Kaline."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00123",
    "start": 298.15,
    "end": 300.15,
    "transcript": "So Kaline, tell me about you."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00123",
    "start": 300.15,
    "end": 305.15,
    "transcript": "Hi, welcome to my garage. This is my car, it's under construction."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00123",
    "start": 305.15,
    "end": 308.15,
    "transcript": "I have to be glad to be there."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00123",
    "start": 308.15,
    "end": 312.15,
    "transcript": "This is the beginning of the King of Europe championship."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00123",
    "start": 312.15,
    "end": 315.15,
    "transcript": "How many years have you been drifting? When did you start?"
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00123",
    "start": 315.15,
    "end": 318.15,
    "transcript": "I started 4 years ago."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00123",
    "start": 318.15,
    "end": 323.15,
    "transcript": "At that time I was like a drunk, drifting."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00123",
    "start": 323.15,
    "end": 327.15,
    "transcript": "What's on the bank in your BMW?"
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00123",
    "start": 327.15,
    "end": 329.15,
    "transcript": "It's an MG46 turbo."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00123",
    "start": 329.15,
    "end": 333.15,
    "transcript": "And I hope to have 600 horsepower."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00123",
    "start": 333.15,
    "end": 335.15,
    "transcript": "600 horsepower, it's a lot."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00123",
    "start": 335.15,
    "end": 337.15,
    "transcript": "It's enough for you?"
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00123",
    "start": 337.15,
    "end": 338.15,
